    "title": "BOOMTOON - \u0e40\u0e27\u0e47\u0e1a\u0e15\u0e39\u0e19 \u0e21\u0e31\u0e19\u0e2e\u0e27\u0e32",
    "description": "BOOMTOON, an app for reading manga online Original copyright webtoon archive from Korea Don't miss it!\r\n\r\nMeet great promotions! Half price cut for first coin purchase. Next purchase up to 40% off and many other promotions in the app only!\r\n\r\n\u27a4 The right source of Y cartoons\r\nSatisfied with a huge collection of BL cartoons from Korea Ready to translate Thai to read together with the best\r\n\r\n\u27a4 Various styles read every day\r\nNot just Y, but there are also many fun and fun webtoons to choose from in your favorite style, all flavors, fantasy, romance, Yuri (Yuri, GL), update new episodes every day, no loneliness.\r\n\r\n\u27a4 Beautiful, clear images, tight quality\r\nSatisfied with colorful cartoon images in Korean style. Guarantees sharpness without reducing image size.\r\n\r\n\u27a4 Great search hashtags\r\nHelp find the right story style with hashtags, complete with all categories.\r\n\r\n\u27a4 Enthusiastic events\r\nFind fun events and prizes. Follow and join in the fun in the app.\r\n\r\nInstall BOOMTOON for free now and find a huge library of fun comics waiting for you.\r\n\r\nFollow news, promotions and preview beautiful cartoons at\r\nFacebook : Boomtoon\r\nTwitter : @BoomtoonTH\r\nInstagram : boomtoon_th\r\n\r\n\u203b BOOMTOON's access rights while using the service\r\n1. Required Access Rights : Storage\r\n - Content Storage\r\n2. Access rights (choose) : Camera\r\n - Access to user image data",
